  partName: Lower Mounting Bolt
  description: The Lower Mounting Bolt is a tiny, complex bolt positioned at the
    top-center-center of the engine, responsible for securing the engine's lower
    mount and maintaining its alignment. Made of Material.001, this bolt provides
    a strong and reliable connection, working in tandem with the upper mounting bolt
    to ensure the engine's stability and balance. Notably, its complex shape enables
    it to accommodate the engine's mounts and other components, making it an essential
    part of the engine's assembly and operation.
